   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> Subscribe <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_CommunicationManagement.pdf#nameddest=SWS_CM_11601\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_CommunicationManagement.pdf)\">[SWS_CM_11601]</a></span> <span class=\"ups\">Upstream: <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_RS_CommunicationManagement.pdf#nameddest=RS_CM_00103\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_RS_CommunicationManagement.pdf)\">RS_CM_00103</a></span></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_Result_d51722.html\">ara::core::Result</a>&lt; void &gt; Subscribe (<a class=\"cppref\" href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/types/size_t\" title=\"cppreference.com (C++17)\">std::size_t</a> maxSampleCount) noexcept;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Method to subscribe to a service field notification. If the Field is already in state kSubscribed or in state kSubscriptionPending at the time of the call, and the provided maxSample Count value is the same as for the current subscription, the method shall return without action.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
